- The one substantive Enneagram essay — Tim Vreeland, *Enneagram Monthly*, July 2024 — independently types him a **self-preservation Seven**, matching our draft's 7w8. **It's paywalled.**

So the free web has no defended argument about Wright's type, and the only expert who wrote one agrees with us.

